{"unit_id":"lucifergzsz414__dsh-windows-native#card-zh","repo":"lucifergzsz414/dsh-windows-native","commit":"97d206dec89b14dc0520651178ddd0f655ae0e99","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-windows-native 是面向原生 Windows 的 DSH 提示扩展，会在系统提示中加入 PowerShell、编码和文件系统操作要点。它通过 systemPrompt 注入文本，默认仅在 Windows 平台启用，也可配置为始终启用，并支持调整提示顺序和追加自定义说明。内容涵盖命令语法、非 ASCII 文本处理、路径与链接、文件锁、容器挂载和后台进程等场景，适合在 Windows 上运行 DSH 的开发者。无需额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:4-75","index.js:78-105"]}
{"unit_id":"lucifergzsz414__dsh-windows-native#card-en","repo":"lucifergzsz414/dsh-windows-native","commit":"97d206dec89b14dc0520651178ddd0f655ae0e99","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-windows-native adds PowerShell, encoding, and filesystem guidance to DSH system prompts on Windows. It covers shell syntax, paths, file locks, and background processes. Injection can be enabled everywhere, reordered, and extended with custom notes. No API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:4-75","index.js:78-105"]}
